          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 NW                  PITSTONE              CHEDDINGTON ROAD 4/141                                           Greenacres - -                                               II House.  C17 2-bay wing to S.W., possibly L-plan but with rear wing altered, and with C20 wing to rear forming U-plan.  C17 wing is timber framed with whitewashed plaster infill to ground floor and brick infill to first floor. Whitewashed plastered plinth.  Old tile roof, rebuilt brick chimney to rear.  2 storeys, 2 bays.  C20 paired leaded casements to first floor, 2 paired casements and central horizontal sliding sash, partly leaded, to ground floor.  C20 door to right in gabled rustic porch with remains of thatched roof. Lean-to to right with paired leaded casements.  N.W. front has 3 bays, the outer gabled with bargeboards.  Left bay is of brick, centre bay part brick, part whitewashed render.  Interior of C17 wing has moulded spine beam. Listing NGR: SP9342515940"
    }
  ],
